{ "The deadline for applying for an EEA family permit is not specified in the text. However, it is mentioned that the EEA family permit is ending on 30 June 2021, and you will not be able to apply for one or use it to travel to the UK after then, even if the expiry date on it is later. To come to the UK after 30 June 2021, you might be able to apply for an EU Settlement Scheme family permit. ":

"However, it is also mentioned that you can apply for an EU Settlement Scheme family permit if you have a retained right of residence or a derivative right of residence. The deadline for applying for an EU Settlement Scheme family permit is 30 June 2021, or within 3 months of when you first arrive in the UK, whichever is later. " 

